#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:50
msgid ""
"Low ANC waters (See section on "
":ref:`heading_Buffering_Capacity_of_Natural_Waters`.) could have their ANC "
"increased by addition of a base. A simpler approach is often to use a "
"different coagulant that is less acidic."
msgstr ""
"Aguas con bajo ANC (véase la sección sobre "
":ref:`heading_Buffering_Capacity_of_Natural_Waters`.) podrían tener su ANC "
"aumentado mediante la adición de una base. Un enfoque más sencillo suele ser"
" usar un coagulante diferente que sea menos ácido."

#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:52
msgid ""
"Polyaluminum chloride (PACl) is another aluminum based coagulant that "
"performs similarly to alum. PACl is manufactured by slowly titrating an "
"acidic solution containing dissolved aluminum with a base (in the chemical "
"plant) to produce a meta-stable and soluble polymeric aluminum. PACl "
"consumes less alkalinity (ANC) because it is partially neutralized by the "
"titration with a base. In addition, the aluminum mass fraction of PACl is "
"higher than in alum because there are no attached water molecules. The mass "
"of PACl required for flocculation is less the mass of alum required. This is"
" due largely to the higher aluminum fraction. The lower mass of PACl "
"required is an economic benefit when shipping is a significant portion of "
"the cost of the coagulant."
msgstr ""
"El cloruro de polialuminio (PACl) es otro coagulante a base de aluminio que "
"funciona de forma similar al sulfato de aluminio. El PACl se fabrica titulando "
"lentamente una solución ácida que contiene aluminio disuelto con una base "
"(en la planta química) para producir un aluminio polimérico metaestable y "
"soluble. El PACl consume menos alcalinidad (ANC) porque queda parcialmente "
"neutralizado por la titulación con una base. Además, la fracción mássica de "
"aluminio del PACl es mayor que en el sulfato de aluminio porque no hay moléculas de agua"
" adheridas. La masa de PACl requerida para la floculación es menor que la "
"masa de sulfato de aluminio requerida. Esto se debe en gran parte a la mayor fracción de"
" aluminio. La menor masa de PACl requerida es un beneficio económico cuando "
"el envío representa una parte significativa del coste del coagulante."

#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:54
msgid ""
"There are many different molecular formulas given for PACl. The molecular "
"formulas are either from the perspective of the chemical supplier or "
"represent the composition of the PACl nanoparticles. The molecular formula "
"from the chemical supplier represents the extent of neutralization and hence"
" the replacement of chloride with hydroxide. In that case the PACl molecular"
" formula is:"
msgstr ""
"Existen muchas fórmulas moleculares diferentes dadas para PACl. Las fórmulas"
" moleculares son desde la perspectiva del proveedor químico o representan la"
" composición de las nanopartículas PACl. La fórmula molecular del proveedor "
"químico representa el grado de neutralización y, por tanto, la sustitución "
"del cloruro por hidróxido. En ese caso, la fórmula molecular de PACl es:"

#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:56
msgid ""
"[Al_n(OH)_mCl_{3n-m}]_x\n"
"\n"
msgstr "[Al_n(OH)_mCl_{3n-m}]_x"

