"base que debe añadirse para alcanzar un pH objetivo."

#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:74
msgid ""
"The molecular formula of the PACl nanoparticles is always some combination "
"of Al, O, and H. One common molecular structure is a Keggin structure with "
