"AlO_4Al_{12}(OH)_{24}(H_2O)_{12}^{7+}\n"
"\n"
msgstr "AlO_4Al_{12}(OH)_{24}(H_2O)_{12}^{7+}"

#: ../../Chemistry_of_Water_Treatment/Chemistry_Intro.rst:78
msgid ""
"The attached water molecules are sometimes omitted. Coagulant nanoparticles "
"are presumably created by aggregation of these Keggin structure molecules."
msgstr ""
"Las moléculas de agua unidas a veces se omiten. Presumiblemente, las "
